{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "6EFRI7EA7EJJ4RR5YL6VO3L3OMSECWFN",
    "type": "home",
    "storyId": "00000021015001",
    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "やあドトウ。\r\nよければボクと併走しないかい？",
            "enText": "Greetings, Doto. Care to join me \nfor some partner running?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -4134016250990207948,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "えぇっ！？　わ、私なんかが\r\nお相手でいいんですか……！？",
            "enText": "Wh-What?! Y-You want <i>me</i> to be \nyour partner…?!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 5636631420707025703,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "もちろんだとも。君となら鼓動を\r\nシンクロできると思っているよ！",
            "enText": "But of course! I have no doubt that you and I\nwill be able to synchronize splendidly!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 1497543623609610148,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "恐れ多いですが、わかりましたぁ……！\r\nが、がんばってシンクロしま――",
            "enText": "I-In that case, how could I refuse?! \nI'll do my best to ——",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -7682394345283209205,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "あれ、シンクロ？　ということは\r\n水泳……？　でもさっき併走って――",
            "enText": "Hm? Synchronize? Like synchronized \nswimming? Y-You said partner <i>running,</i> right?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -8369357647508178380,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "ふふっ、2匹のバタフライのように美しい\r\nリフレインを繰り広げようじゃないか！",
            "enText": "Hehe, may the refrain we compose \nbe as beautiful as two butterflies \nstroking the wind with their wings!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 4345290481634237414,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "バ、バタフライ！？\r\nやっぱり水泳ですねっ……！？",
            "enText": "B-Butterfly strokes?! \nSo you <i>do</i> mean swimming!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -5841400576163133818,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "承知しました！\r\nい、急いで水着に着替えてきます～……っ！",
            "enText": "N-No worries, I can handle that! \nI just need to go change into my swimsuit!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 3377949042338413994,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "うん、水着……？",
            "enText": "Hm? Swimsuit?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 6125077941151568544,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "ハッ――あますことなく肉体美を\r\n披露しようというんだね！　素晴らしい！",
            "enText": "Aha! Wearing swimsuits while running \nwould indeed be a sight to behold! \nA marvelous idea!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 1896068240542431991,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "では、ボクも水着になるとしようっ！",
            "enText": "Then I too shall don my swimsuit!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 4190440743460278519,
            "blockIdx": 11
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1776630564,
    "humanTl": true
}